Package: NtC
Type: Package
Title: Non-Toxic Concentrations (NtC) from Dose-Response Data
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-09-29
Authors@R: c(
    person("Christoph", "Schür", email = "christoph.schuer@eawag.ch", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Determines the non-toxic concentration (NtC) of chemicals from cell-line
    dose-response data according to Stadnicka-Michalak et al. (2018)
    <doi:10.14573/altex.1701231>. Offers the original algorithm, reproduced including its
    quirks, and an updated algorithm based on the 'bendr' package, with robust file import
    and a 'shiny' app.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/schuerc/NtC_update
BugReports: https://github.com/schuerc/NtC_update/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
